{"summary": "In this room, looking from the entrance, three white softbox lights made with lightweight diffused rectangular fabric are arranged: softbox light 1 is mounted on a black telescopic adjustable lighting stand 1, positioned at a 45-degree angle to a brass vintage camera made with aged metal and leather, which sits atop a dark brown sturdy wooden tripod 1, placed 0.5 meters in front of a weathered rustic wooden stool made with reclaimed wood. Softbox light 2 is mounted on another black telescopic adjustable lighting stand 2, angled toward a deep green smooth backdrop hanging opposite an oval-shaped gilded ornamental wall mirror mounted above a dark brown tufted leather armchair. Softbox light 3 is placed 1.5 meters away from a matte black smooth backdrop hanging behind the armchair, which is positioned 2 meters from the backdrop. A muted beige handwoven antique rug lies beneath the rustic wooden stool, near a rustic brown slatted wooden storage crate containing a rolled-up crisp white smooth backdrop. On top of the crate rests a delicate dried floral arrangement made with preserved flowers, while a silver circular metal reflector 1 leans against it. A second silver metal reflector 2 sits next to a black boxy old film projector made with metal and plastic, placed on the rustic wooden stool. Another dark brown wooden tripod 2 stands 1 meter to the left of the leather armchair, completing the nostalgic, earthy setup."}
```

